Your suggestions are quite interesting, and include one or two that have
occured to me (the wormhole, though curiously not the time warp).

I have one problem with your ideas for the wormhole- in any two games of
Nethack, objects never appear the same. Therefore, knowledge gained in
one really wouldn't apply in the other! Even worse, any unidentified
objects carried across would either change in appearance or have to be
specially handled.... hmmm!

(I'm speaking solely of potions here of course. But how about this- a
green potion remains a green potion... but takes on the new meaning of
a green potion in the other game! This could be a good surprise.)

How about this for a troublesome new feature: the harem! An addition to
the existing monster zoos and whatnot- but watch out for those nasty
eunuchs, or you may join them... (-: - Of course there would have to be
games played with the gender code to make this one work.



